  - "THOX"
notes: "Third Edition (v3.0), Process v1.0 reissue (2026-11-04) of the Second Edition, hardened paper-version 2.1 (2026-10-30). Byline as published in the second edition, finalized under Tommy Xaypanya's ruling of 2026-11-04: Sadie Weaving (preparer); Tommy Xaypanya (accountable human author, corresponding author). The DOI of record is recorded in the pack HANDOFF.md and the THOX research-publishing pipeline manifest."
